    'n2elf_reloc.c: plain REL; the Android packed format ("APS2" magic, SLEB128 groups with the GROUPED_BY_INFO / GROUPED_BY_OFFSET_DELTA / GROUPED_BY_ADDEND / HAS_ADDEND flags, as documented in the Android linker design notes); RELR bitmaps. Types R_ARM_RELATIVE(23), R_ARM_GLOB_DAT(21), R_ARM_JUMP_SLOT(22), R_ARM_ABS32(2); anything else is an error naming the type.',
