   'annexb.c against streams produced by ffmpeg/x264/x265 in run_tests.sh: the avcC/hvcC built must equal the extradata ffmpeg writes into an MP4 for the same stream (extract with ffprobe -show_data or by parsing the box in the test); the VT object against gpu/video\'s fake CoreFoundation/VideoToolbox runtime with a fake n2vcd client (function-pointer seam) that returns a canned stream.',
   ['bash gpu/hwcodec/vt/test/run_tests.sh -> N2TEST P04 PASS n/n','objects compile for arm64-apple-ios16.0 (through hw-ip)'],
